    dcterms:description "A static, read-only Wikibase of OpenStreetMap benchmarks (survey points with a Wikimedia Commons image) in Ireland, Northern Ireland and Scotland. One item per OSM element, its version history as statements, anchored in CIDOC CRM." ;
